  "card": {
    "title": "SpecKit Pilot should auto-load assigned tickets on open (Import becomes a manual reload)",
    "type": "feature",
    "scope": "# Summary\n\nOpening the SpecKit Pilot board should automatically pull down assigned ticket data (Linear/Jira) and reconcile it onto the board on load — no manual import step required. The existing \"Import ticket\" button should remain, but as a manual reload/refresh option rather than the only way to get tickets onto the board.\n\n# Context\n\nToday the board only fetches ticket data when the user explicitly opens the Import ticket modal — `ImportTicketModal` calls `ticketList()` on mount and the user picks tickets one at a time to create cards. Users expect their assigned work to appear as soon as they open the extension. The main tradeoff is that an automatic fetch on load adds a network call at startup and requires deduplication so re-opening/reloading does not create duplicate cards for tickets already on the board.\n\n# Acceptance Criteria\n\n- [ ] Opening SpecKit Pilot automatically fetches assigned tickets from configured sources (Linear/Jira) without any manual action\n- [ ] Fetched tickets that are not already cards appear on the board (e.g. in Backlog)\n- [ ] Re-opening or reloading does not create duplicate cards for tickets already imported (dedup by ticket source key)\n- [ ] The \"Import ticket\" button remains available and now acts as a manual reload/refresh\n- [ ] If no source is configured or the fetch fails, the board still loads and surfaces the error via a toast (no crash)\n- [ ] Auto-load respects the existing assignee filter (only the user's assigned tickets), consistent with current `ticketList` behavior\n\n# Dev Hints\n\n* Current manual path: `extensions/speckit-pilot/src/renderer/components/ImportTicketModal.tsx` fetches via `getSpeckitAPI().ticketList()` on mount, then calls `cardCreate()` per selected ticket.\n* Fetch source (assignee-filtered): `extensions/speckit-pilot/src/api/linear.ts` `fetchAssignedTickets()`.\n* Board home + overlay wiring: `extensions/speckit-pilot/src/renderer/App.tsx` (`overlay === 'import'`, `BoardView`).\n* Reuse the existing `cardCreate` / card-list IPC for reconciliation; dedup on the ticket source key (`Ticket.key` / Linear `identifier`).\n* Keep the `Download` icon affordance for the manual refresh.",
